## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior SaaS product architect, school-front-office workflow specialist, examination-management specialist, frontend engineer, UX designer, accessibility specialist, and QA engineer.

Implement Prompt 8 in the existing SCHLAR application. Build two distinct, complete role workspaces:

