### Conflict detection

Detect relevant conflicts using the available data, including:

- A class scheduled for two exams at the same time.
- A subject or examination assigned inconsistently.
- An invigilator assigned to overlapping sessions, when invigilator assignment exists.
- A room assigned to overlapping exams, when room allocation exists.
- Invalid or overlapping time ranges.

Prevent invalid schedules from being saved unless the existing policy explicitly allows an override. If overrides are allowed, require appropriate authorization, confirmation, and an audit record where supported.

Do not simply display a warning and then silently accept an invalid schedule.

